{"title":"Sheep","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 2 Wildlife that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-344.2px,-220.3px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/0/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/0/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:256px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:0px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:256px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/2/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:0px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/2/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:256px\"><i style=\"left:343.8px;top:221.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:259.9px;top:185.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:328.2px;top:219.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:339.7px;top:218.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:330.9px;top:226.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:364.8px;top:224.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:255.8px;top:185.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:254.5px;top:184.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:346.8px;top:215.0px\"></i></div><figcaption>Plymouth Wharf</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 11 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Havenheim\">Havenheim</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" clas